<title>USA: U.S. brass mill inventories down in April - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. brass mill inventories down in April - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. brass mill inventories fell to 138,793 short tons (copper content) at the end of April from a revised total of 144,219 short tons in March, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Total brass mill shipments for April rose to 163,764 short tons from 159,721 short tons in March.  Total receipts were 99,557 short tons in the month, up from March's revised total of 90,984 short tons.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
